{"ID":"20240118145016-zxz6gk4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145016-zxz6gk4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145016-zxz6gk4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145016-g5e36wf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122161510-y7sk8gb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122161510-y7sk8gb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:296,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:296\u0026#125;","title":"316柳花","type":"doc","updated":"20240124115759"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145016-g5e36wf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145016-g5e36wf","updated":"20240122161425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，寒，无毒。治风水，黄疸，面热黑。叶，治马疥，痂疮。实，主溃痈，逐脓血。生川泽。一名柳絮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161428-y66qtcr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161428-y66qtcr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】江南一带，生湖畔河堤处。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161429-uc1t48b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161429-uc1t48b"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】柳絮，柳枝，柳叶，柳根皆味苦，性寒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161430-hew2acz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161430-hew2acz"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】柳絮为祛湿，解热，止痛药，治黄疸，湿痹,金疮及脚气。柳叶可疗疥，洗漆疮，解热毒，止痛。柳枝及根白皮能解热，止痛，消肿。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161433-eo2drq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161433-eo2drq2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】主痂疥，恶疮，金疮，实主溃脓，逐脓血，子汁疗渴。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161434-sduc5lz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161434-sduc5lz"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】主止血，治湿痹，四肢挛急膝痛。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161436-wgfzx30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161436-wgfzx30"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】煎膏续筋骨长肉止痛，主服金石人大发热闷，汤火疮毒入腹闷热，及疔毒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161439-oir0zme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161439-oir0zme"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏敬】柳枝与根主治痰热淋疾，可为浴汤，洗风肿疮疡，煮酒漱齿痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161440-24kigrg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161440-24kigrg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【时珍】煎服治黄疸，白浊，酒煮熨诸肿痛，去风，止痛，消肿。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161442-r9gm944","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161442-r9gm944"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【附方】金疮出血——柳絮封之即止。脚多汗湿——柳絮着鞋袜内穿之。眉毛脱落——柳叶阴干为末，以姜汁在铁器内调膏，夜夜抹之。黄疸初起——柳枝煮浓汁半升，顿服。乳痈妒乳——初起坚紫，众疗不愈，柳根皮熟捣，火温棉裹慰之，冷更易，一宿消。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161446-i1jc8v3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161446-i1jc8v3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161447-40zk63s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161447-40zk63s"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】寒症忌用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161448-8zronw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161448-8zronw8"}},{"ID":"20240122161448-ec64u99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161448-ec64u99","updated":"20240122161453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个316就是柳花，他叫柳花，实际上我们看到的江南一带河边都有种柳树，我们台湾也很多种柳树，你到公园里面就可以看到种的柳树，台中也有，台中公园也有柳树，公园水旁边都有柳树。"}]},{"ID":"20240122161500-aoe5wzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161500-aoe5wzx","updated":"20240122161506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个柳树非常好，全身是药。当然你不要让上面的寄生虫拿来当药。我们讲的全身是药，你看它的柳絮、柳条、柳叶、柳枝、柳树的根通通可以用，所以你看它处在江南一带，柳絮、柳条、柳枝、柳叶和柳根都可以使用。你要知道一些这个柳树的东西，经方张仲景没有用这个药，但是你有机会用到。因为这一棵树有那么多功能在里面，尤其你到江南一带的时候，都可以使用。它能够祛湿解热，止痛，因为柳絮就是柳花嘛，能祛湿止痛，治黄疸，湿痹都可以，柳树的叶子，那个长条形的叶子，好像蒸叶洗疥疮，身上的疮，解热毒。柳枝和根白皮呢，那树根的白皮，消肿止痛，使用上面非常好用。"}]},{"ID":"20240122161510-y7sk8gb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161510-y7sk8gb","updated":"20240122161512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你看附方，这个都是经验的，好的东西我给你列进来给你看。你看金疮出血，柳絮，这个脚多汗，汗太多，怎样呢？诸位自己看就可以了。第五个，胸部的、乳房的硬块，你如果是乳房的、乳癌的初期，有硬块在里面，颜色是坚紫、硬非常的硬，而且颜色是紫色的，这个时候刚开始，没有切片，什么都没有，你可以用柳根，效果很好。用不用无所谓，只是一般你去药房里面买柳根，没有。你要去公园自己去挖，带着铲子自己去砍两根回来。无所谓，不要，趁人家没人在里面，因为那药房很累嘛，都是拿来种，怎么办呢？因为他们不会用，你只好自己去砍，不需要很多哦，没事你带剪刀去剪下柳条，一般你到药房里面没有，这个药必须自己去搜。"}]}]}